checks.ts and model.ts are copied unchanged from spicylyrics/discord-bot
(Source/helpers/ttmlLint, commit 03e16e2). index.ts is that folder's index.ts
cut down to lintTtml; the Discord message rendering is left out. Don't edit
these files: resync them from the source instead.

